Theme fonts (self-hosted, no CDN, no local() fallbacks):

- Inter v4.1 (Regular 400, SemiBold 600), SIL OFL 1.1
  https://github.com/rsms/inter/releases/tag/v4.1
- JetBrains Mono v2.304 (Regular 400, Bold 700), SIL OFL 1.1
  https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono/releases/tag/v2.304
- Ionicons v4.6.2 icon font (ionicons.woff2), MIT
  https://github.com/ionic-team/ionicons/releases/tag/v4.6.2
  woff2 ONLY: the upstream package also ships eot, svg, ttf and woff, which no
  browser able to run this theme would ever request. Declared in
  css/ionicons.min.css (see the local-modification note at the top of that file).
  4.6.2 is the last Ionicons release with an icon font; v5 and later are SVG web
  components, so there is no newer version of this file to move to.

Declared in css/typography.css; consumed only via --dz-font-family /
--dz-font-mono tokens (see DESIGN.md Typography and scripts/check-typography.sh).
